'''''Carex  divisa ''''' is a species of [[Carex|sedge]] known by the common names '''divided sedge'''<ref>[http://www.bfap.org/uploads/docs/ivided_sedge.pdf  Divided sedge] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240419072915/http://www.bfap.org/uploads/docs/ivided_sedge.pdf |date=2024-04-19 }} Broadland Flood Alleviation Project</ref><ref name=BSBI07>{{BSBI 2007 |accessdate=2014-10-17 }}</ref> and '''separated sedge'''.<ref>{{PLANTS|id=CADI8|taxon=Carex divisa|accessdate=11 January 2016}}</ref> It is native to Europe, Asia, and North Africa, and considered naturalized in Australia, New Zealand, and scattered locations in North America.<ref>[http://apps.kew.org/wcsp/namedetail.do?name_id=226132 Kew World Checklist of Selected Plant Families]</ref>

